rain
title Biscuit: each block appends a check
(Service)-[/(Service)]->(Alice)                                       : the authority block
(Alice)-[/(Service) where check if time($t), $t < 2026-12-01]->(Bob)  : attenuation block 1
(Bob)-[/(Service) where check if operation("read")]->(Carol)          : attenuation block 2
(Carol)=[[/]]=>(Service)                                              : must pass both checks
